  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 30 2023",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Congenital Pseudoarthrosis of Clavicle is the failure of fusion of the medial and lateral ossification centers of the clavicle.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made with radiographs of the clavicle showing a rounded sclerotic bone at pseudoarthrosis site in the absence of trauma.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is observation in the case of minimal symptoms and cosmetic deformity. Surgical management is indicated in the event of persistent pain or functional limitations.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rare",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "right side most common",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "situs inversus is the exception",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "bilateral in <10%",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
